      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "¿Es mensaje de texto?",
      "notes": "Meta manda por el mismo webhook los acuses (sent/delivered/read) y los audios/imagenes. Sin este filtro el flujo intenta procesarlos y explota.\nLa segunda condicion exige saber quien escribe: telefono (from / wa_id) o identidad (from_user_id / user_id)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ],
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Ignorar evento"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.messages[0].text.body }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
              "name": "phone",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.messages?.[0]?.from || $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.contacts?.[0]?.wa_id || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.contacts?.[0]?.profile?.name || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
              "name": "conversationId",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.messages?.[0]?.from || $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.contacts?.[0]?.wa_id || $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.messages?.[0]?.from_user_id || $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.contacts?.[0]?.user_id || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
